  "description": "Leon Kierhi, the esteemed Commander of the Imperial Knights, renounces his title to pledge eternal loyalty to Prince Sienn. However, this devotion leads him into a harrowing nightmare when Prince Sonah uses a potent drug to erode Kierhi’s caution and pain, subjecting the upright knight to a series of degrading acts designed to shatter his pride. The betrayal reaches its peak as Sonah forces Kierhi to confront his lowest moment with Sienn, turning a sacred vow of service into a cruel cycle of trauma.\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
